### Mekong Mobile CRM - Warranty Receipt & Triage API Testing (Workflow L2)
### Environment Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Probes
# @name HealthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
# @name DatabaseHealth
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/db
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 2. Authentication & Session Management
# @name LoginSystemAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "system.admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
# @name LoginStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "staff.hcm",
  "password": "123456"
}

###
# @name GetCurrentUser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 3. Master Data
# @name GetCenters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/centers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
# @name GetCategories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 4. Customer Lookup & Registration (QT-01)
# @name LookupCustomerSuccess
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers?phone=+84901234567
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
# @name LookupCustomerNotFound
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers?phone=0999999999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Ticket Receipt & Intake Triage (QT-03, QT-04, QT-05)
# @name CreateTicketSuccess
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "customer_phone": "0901234567",
  "customer_name": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "product_id": 5,
  "product_name": "iPhone 15 Pro",
  "serial_imei": "SN-NEW-10293",
  "center_id": 1,
  "store_id": "STORE_01",
  "category_id": 1,
  "priority": "CAO",
  "issue_description": "Màn hình bị sọc xanh và không lên nguồn khi cắm sạc",
  "sold_at": "2026-06-01"
}

###
# @name CreateTicketMissingFields
# Expected: 400 Bad Request with missing fields listed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customer_name": "Nguyễn Văn A"
}

###
# @name CreateTicketDuplicateSerial
# Expected: 409 Conflict with PHIEU_DANG_MO (QT-09)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "customer_phone": "0901234567",
  "customer_name": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "product_id": 5,
  "serial_imei": "SN-NEW-10293",
  "center_id": 1,
  "category_id": 1,
  "priority": "CAO",
  "issue_description": "Tiếp tục tạo phiếu trùng serial khi phiếu trước chưa xong",
  "sold_at": "2026-06-01"
}

### 6. Ticket Management & Lifecycle Transitions (QT-06)
# @name GetTicketList
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?center_id=1&status=MOI
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
# @name GetTicketDetail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/TKT-8801
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
# @name UpdateTicketStatusSuccess
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/TKT-8801/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "DA_TIEP_NHAN",
  "updated_by": "NV_KHOI",
  "note": "Tiếp nhận thiết bị tại quầy và chuyển kỹ thuật viên"
}

###
# @name UpdateTicketStatusRollbackViolation
# Expected: 409 Conflict with TRANG_THAI_KHONG_HOP_LE (QT-06)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/TKT-8801/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "MOI",
  "updated_by": "NV_TEST"
}

### 7. Security: Broken Access Control (OWASP A01:2025)
# @name ApproveWarrantyExceptionForbidden
# Expected: 403 Forbidden for Staff role
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/TKT-8801/warranty-exception
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "approved": true,
  "reason": "Phê duyệt ngoại lệ bảo hành"
}

